# The generated dashboard is a snapshot of live business data — money taken,
# customer counts, what the AI cost us. It is regenerated by one command in a few
# seconds, so there is no reason to keep it, and every reason not to commit it.
#
# It contains no keys (run.mjs refuses to write the file if it does), but it is
# still a private picture of the business and it does not belong in a repository.
*.html
